Package: bisquite-teleport-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Letenkov Maksim <letenkovmaksim@yandex.ru>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: bash (>= 5), coreutils, util-linux, curl, ca-certificates
Recommends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/iamletenkov/bisquite-teleport-agent
Description: Teleport node agent: SSH node, web apps, portal labels
 bisquite-teleport joins the machine to a Teleport cluster as an SSH node
 and publishes its loopback web apps (declarations in
 /etc/bisquite/teleport/apps.d). It renders /etc/teleport.yaml from
 /etc/bisquite/teleport/config, scrubs the join token after registration,
 publishes the os_logins label and can take the space and env labels from
 a portal implementing GET /robot-api/v1/labels.
 .
 The Teleport binary is not part of this package: install it to
 /usr/local/bin/teleport (release tarball, mirror or apt).
